you know.

68
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:27,080
Well then, let's see you point
out where the capital of America is.

69
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:30,680
I think it's around here.

70
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,720
That's Los Angeles.

71
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,940
Right? I thought so.

72
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:38,840
The capital is New York, so -

73
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,240
It's Washington.

74
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,460
When did that change?

75
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:44,180
You idiot!

76
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:46,660
Did the whole family stay
up all night studying?

77
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:47,840
You... you!

78
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,460
