250
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:21,900
Forget it. Why do I have to keep a
household ledger like some housewife?

251
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:24,700
The money.

252
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,200
What? A souvenir list?

253
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:33,180
You expect me to buy
all this with this money?

254
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:36,300
Do you think I'm some kind
of importer or something?

255
00:14:36,300 --> 00:14:36,900
Did you wait long?

256
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:40,880
This is ridiculous.

257
00:14:52,020 --> 00:14:53,160
Boy, I slept well.

258
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,400
Here, Max.

259
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:58,500
Here, Sunday.

260
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,020
Isn't she a beautiful lady?

261
00:15:01,020 --> 00:15:02,140
Hurry up and get in.

262
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:10,340
That lady from before,
is she your girlfriend?

263
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:13,440
I'm a married man with kids,
so don't ask unnecessary questions.

264
00:15:13,980 --> 00:15:16,140
Yeah, yeah, got it.

265
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,460
Was she?
She doesn't have any charm at all, does she?

266
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:29,060
Wow, amazing.

267
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:33,600
Just as expected of New York,
a treasure trove of crime.

268
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:36,400
Cops would need more than nine lives here.

269
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:38,440
This place is nothing like Japan.

270
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,740
Japan's safety is so good

271
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:44,280
simply because ordinary
people don't carry guns.

272
00:15:44,820 --> 00:15:47,960
That's why a guy like you
can even manage to be a cop.

273
00:15:48,467 --> 00:15:52,360
Listen, we're going to see each other
every day for over a week from now on.

274
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,080
Could you at least try to...

275
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:56,804
W-what?

276
00:15:56,854 --> 00:15:58,440
That bastard.

277
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,780
G-Goat!

278
00:16:06,580 --> 00:16:08,920
Don't move! Move and I'll shoot!

279
00:16:09,420 --> 00:16:11,020
Put your hands on top of your head.

280
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,180
As always, that was impressive.

281
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:14,880
Wait!

282
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:17,100
Leave the rest to me.

283
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:21,560
Wow, that was one hell of a rough arrest.

284
00:16:22,300 --> 00:16:23,180
It's over.

285
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,040
Thanks.

286
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:29,600
Isn't that the sister from earlier?

287
00:16:30,100 --> 00:16:33,480
This is Zebra 6,
we're in an alley on 52nd Street.

288
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:36,080
We made an arrest in the act with Mike-go.

289
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:40,840
You're the Japanese policeman
who came for training, right?

290
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:43,120
I'm Sunday, nice to meet you.

291
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:46,200
I'm Kankichi Ryotsu, nice to meet you.

292
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,620
Why don't you two come to my house tonight?

293
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,740
I'll treat you to dinner.

294
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:54,900
I don't mind.

295
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:56,200
What? Really?

296
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,880
Yes, then tonight at seven.

297
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,360
Be sure to come.

298
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,040
Yeah.

299
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,120
This is Harlem.

300
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:10,580
What is this place?

301
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:13,400
Since they call it Harlem, I figured

302
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,400
beautiful young ladies would
be swarming all over the place.

303
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:18,040
But look, it's nothing but
a bunch of shifty-eyed thugs!

304
00:17:18,820 --> 00:17:21,160
Just try setting foot in here as a tourist,

305
00:17:21,620 --> 00:17:22,700
and you'll get beaten to a pulp.

306
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,280
It's just a closed-off place, isn't it?

307
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:28,500
Hey, you!
This isn't a place for the likes of you.

308
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:29,480
Get out of here, now.

309
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:32,700
Ramming even a police car?
They really don't hold back, do they.

310
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:34,680
It's a true lawless zone.

311
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,880
That building's on fire!

312
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:38,360
Hey, it's a fire!

313
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:42,500
They're deliberately setting it like
that to cash in on the fire insurance.

314
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:44,380
It's a common scam.

315
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,660
Fire trucks won't come out here, either.

316
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:49,600
But what if it's a real fire?

317
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:55,760
There's someone in the fire!

318
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:56,860
Hey, stop!

319
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:57,880
Really?

320
00:17:58,280 --> 00:17:59,660
I didn't see anyone.

321
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:01,100
It's true.

322
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:03,580
Hey!

323
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,580
Just as I thought.

324
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:11,900
Hey, don't you have any water? Water!

325
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:12,640
That's hopeless.

326
00:18:13,460 --> 00:18:15,140
It's burned that much already,
it's too late.

327
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:37,640
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!

328
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,800
Use this water to put out the fire!

329
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:52,520
Nice!

330
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:53,900
Are you all right?

331
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:54,900
Old man,

332
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:57,020
are you this old lady's husband?

333
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,180
Yes.

334
00:18:58,180 --> 00:18:59,800
Thank goodness, old woman.

335
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:01,360
Thank you so much.

336
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,880
I don't know how to repay you.

337
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,700
Don't mention it, really.

338
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:11,880
If it weren't for my help,
you'd be burnt to a crisp by now.

339
00:19:12,740 --> 00:19:14,720
What's that?
Are you trying to put me in your debt?

340
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:15,560
What?

341
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:16,580
What is it?

342
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:26,540
I didn't think Japan had cops like you, too.

343
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:28,780
You're not so bad yourself, you know.

344
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:36,060
Max, who hated Japanese so much,

345
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:40,540
I never thought he'd get
this friendly with someone.

346
00:19:40,540 --> 00:19:43,440
Ryo-chan is special. He's a real man.

347
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,720
Ryo-chan?

348
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,220
Yeah, Ryo-chan.

349
00:19:46,220 --> 00:19:50,580
Ryo-chan, is it?
Alright, I'll call you Mar-chan too.

350
00:19:50,580 --> 00:19:55,260
Mar-chan I like that. Well then, Ryo-chan.

351
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:57,360
Ugh, he's a pervert.

352
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:58,200
Pervert.

353
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:01,160
He's not a pervert, he's a pervert!

354
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:05,040
Here's what a pervert does. Watch this.

355
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:06,880
Yes!

356
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:09,660
Oh my God!

357
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:12,700
This is the Japanese pervert dance!

358
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:16,240
Nooo!

359
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,780
Ryo-chan, great!

360
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:52,420
Ryo-chan

361
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:54,680
From today until you return home,

362
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,040
he'll be looking after you in my place.

363
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:58,640
This is Mr. Kato.

364
00:20:58,640 --> 00:20:59,880
Nice to meet you.

365
00:21:00,780 --> 00:21:01,500
Pleased to meet you.

366
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:03,820
Take care.

367
00:21:04,380 --> 00:21:06,440
But Mar-chan, what's going on?

368
00:21:07,040 --> 00:21:07,700
Well, the truth is,

369
00:21:11,020 --> 00:21:19,440
I'm escorting that boy with Sunday to Los Angeles.
I see, thanks for all your help until today.

370
00:21:19,980 --> 00:21:25,660
Thanks. The pleasure was mine.
Enjoy New York until you go home.

371
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:28,440
Well then, Sunday, shall we go?

372
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,280
Come on, let's go.

373
00:21:33,860 --> 00:21:36,634
John, it's going to be a long trip to LA.

374
00:21:36,684 --> 00:21:37,940
Let's get along, okay?

375
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:39,920
Come on, John.

376
00:21:43,980 --> 00:21:45,468
Max, Sunday.

377
00:21:45,518 --> 00:21:49,313
If you ever come to Japan,
come visit me anytime.

378
00:21:49,363 --> 00:21:50,440
You'll be more than welcome.

379
00:21:50,940 --> 00:21:51,300
Yeah.

380
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:52,660
Yes, thank you.

381
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:53,900
Well, see you.

382
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,800
What's that?

383
00:21:58,940 --> 00:22:01,000
Max, you're being targeted with a rifle!

384
00:22:01,260 --> 00:22:01,580
What?

385
00:22:01,580 --> 00:22:02,560
Something's - whoa!

386
00:22:02,980 --> 00:22:03,540
Max!

387
00:22:05,340 --> 00:22:06,460
Sandy, take cover!

388
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:07,960
Max!

389
00:22:08,580 --> 00:22:11,540
Ryo-chan, the culprit...

390
00:22:11,540 --> 00:22:11,960
Alright!

391
00:22:18,180 --> 00:22:18,460
Right!

392
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:20,320
Arrest him right now!

393
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:22,640
Sunday, call an ambulance!

394
00:22:22,740 --> 00:22:23,180
Okay!

395
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:25,900
Max, hang in there!

396
00:22:31,820 --> 00:22:34,160
Ugh... Ryo-chan.

397
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,240
Hey, don't talk anymore.

398
00:22:36,760 --> 00:22:40,420
I'm fine, but I have a favor to ask.

399
00:22:40,420 --> 00:22:41,140
What is it?

400
00:22:41,780 --> 00:22:45,200
I think the ones who shot me
were probably part of the mafia.

401
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:46,180
Mafia?

402
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:48,680
They must have been after John's life.

403
00:22:49,660 --> 00:22:56,180
Can you take John to LA
for me and look after Sami?

404
00:22:57,780 --> 00:23:00,280
Got it, so stop talking now.

405
00:23:01,580 --> 00:23:04,300
I knew Ryo-chan would take care of it.

406
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:05,780
Max!

407
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:08,940
It's okay,
he's just asleep from the anesthetic.

408
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:11,280
Well, then, alright.

409
00:23:11,280 --> 00:23:15,880
This Ryotsu Kankichi will make sure to get John to LA,
you can count on it.

